    Title "14-17 No Online Class"
    Statement "Let the contact know we do not have an online class to book for ages 14 to 17 - our kids program ends at 13 and adult classes are 18 and over. Make sure we have a parent or guardian name, phone, and email on file, let them know our team will reach out directly to help get the teen started, and do not book any appointment."
